{"enabled": false, "text": "```python\ndef binary_search(arr: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return the index of target in sorted arr, or -1 if not found.\"\"\"\n    lo, hi = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    while lo <= hi:\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            lo = mid + 1\n        else:\n            hi = mid - 1\n    return -1\n```", "checks": {"0": [], "1": []}}
